@base = http://127.0.0.1:5000/api

### Liste complète
GET {{base}}/astronautes

### Filtres combinés
GET {{base}}/astronautes?role=commandant&mission=Apollo 12

### Lire un astronaute
GET {{base}}/astronautes/2

### Astronaute inexistant → 404
GET {{base}}/astronautes/999

### Création valide → 201 + Location
POST {{base}}/astronautes
Content-Type: application/json

{"nom": "Michael Collins", "role": "pilote", "mission": "Apollo 11"}

### Création avec champ inconnu → 400
POST {{base}}/astronautes
Content-Type: application/json

{"nom": "X", "role": "pilote", "mission": "Apollo 1", "salaire": 50000}

### Remplacement complet
PUT {{base}}/astronautes/2
Content-Type: application/json

{"nom": "Alan Bean", "role": "pilote", "mission": "Apollo 12"}

### PUT incomplet → 400
PUT {{base}}/astronautes/2
Content-Type: application/json

{"nom": "Alan Bean"}

### Modification partielle
PATCH {{base}}/astronautes/2
Content-Type: application/json

{"role": "commandant"}

### Suppression → 204
DELETE {{base}}/astronautes/2